Adapted files (each carries the original copyright lines and a notice of
what was changed):
  graph.py        the Mesmer network (PanopticNet: Location2D, ResNet50
                  backbone, FPN level P3, four semantic heads) as a
                  functional PyTorch forward pass
  resize.py       Application._resize_input / _resize_output
  preprocess.py   mesmer_preprocess with its defaults
  tiling.py       Application._tile_input / _untile_output
  postprocess.py  format_output_mesmer, Mesmer.predict's post-processing
                  defaults, mesmer_postprocess per compartment
  app.py          the prediction flow of Application._predict_segmentation /
                  _run_model / _batch_predict and Mesmer.predict

The numerical operations themselves (resize, percentile threshold,
histogram normalisation, tile/untile, deep_watershed) are CALLED from the
installed deepcell_toolbox 0.12.1 (same licence), not copied.

